  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  charName: Michelle
  firstLines: []
  secondLines:
  - I MADE IT. I MADE IT. BRO I OVERSLEPT AND I HAD TO SHIT SO BAD THAT I WAS LATE.
  - "I SWEAR. CHRISTINE PLS DON\u2019T MARK ME LATE PLS DON\u2019T MARK ME LATE."
  thirdLines:
  - FINALLYYYY class is over and I can play games omg I love games.
  fourthLines:
  - "Shh shhhhh I can\u2019t be bothered right now."
  - "I\u2019m locked in to How I met your Mother and I cannot have any distractions."
  fifthLines:
  - What? I was craving a late night snack okay.
  - No judgment welcomed here.
  sixthLines:
  - '*pants while pacing*'
  - '*pants while pacing*'
  - '*pants while pacing*'
  - "I can\u2019t sleep bro I\u2019m just gonna keep movin. "
  - '*pants while pacing*'
