--- !u!114 &537514064
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 537514059}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 84246a412e120284ebb2f40012066458, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  charName: Taylor
  firstLines:
  - "Hey broski, man bro I\u2019m barely on time. These goddamn elevators ya know."
  - Anyway, welcome to class, how u doin? (with heavy LA accent)
  secondLines:
  - "DAMN son its warm as fuck outside (it\u2019s 15 degrees Fahrenheight)."
  - "It\u2019s gonna melt off my cunty Makeup (with heavy LA accent)"
  thirdLines:
  - "Have you tried the Chocolate Babka slices bro, they\u2019re awesomeeeee."
  - I eat them every time I come here. (with heavy LA accent).
  fourthLines:
  - "Ya know I know I am not gonna win this game. And that\u2019s okay."
  - I am willing to accept that. I am content with myself not winning this game.
  - "But someone better turn on Marvel Rivals after this shit cause THEN imma beat
    everyone\u2019s ass (with heavy LA Accent)."
  fifthLines:
  - "I don\u2019t wanna but I gotta do my homework so ya know I\u2019m locking in."
  - '*plays the Living Tombstone*'
  - "What. It\u2019s my focusing music (with heavy LA Accent)."
  sixthLines:
  - Shhhhh go awayyyyyy me sleeping now zzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz (with Heavy LA
    accent).
