--- !u!114 &1111279913
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1111279908}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 84246a412e120284ebb2f40012066458, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  charName: Cathy
  firstLines:
  - "Heyo I\u2019m Kathy. I love Yaoi."
  - I am currently drafting a love poem to Yaoi to show it how much I love and appreciate
    it. Anyway here goes. Ahem.
  - "Oh Yaoi. you beautiful, dramatic, slow-burn catastrophe, you genre of almost,
    of glances held a fraction too long and hands that hover like they\u2019re afraid
    of changing the universe."
  - 'I love you in the way one loves rain when it ruins plans but makes everything
    feel cinematic. I love you in the way of unread messages, three dots blinking,
    tension stretched so tight it hums. '
  - "I love you for the men\u2014 grown men, tragically grown, with emotional repression
    stacked like unpaid bills, who stare at each other like if I say this out loud
    I might die, but if I don\u2019t I definitely will. "
  - Awesome so far right? Yeah I know, I'm pretty talented. Anyway, I'm gonna keep
    working on it. I got a lot more to say about this important topic.
  secondLines:
  - OMG you're back! I made more progress on my poem.....Wanna hear?
  - No? Well you're gonna hear it anyway!!! Ahem Ahem...
  - "I love you for the tropes, oh, the tropes\u2014 the rivals who argue as foreplay
    (but metaphorically, relax), the coworkers who pretend professionalism while
    their souls are actively holding hands, the childhood friends who swear they\u2019re
    \u201Clike brothers\u201D right up until fate clears its throat and says, \u201CBe
    serious.\u201D "
  - 'I love you for the yearning. God, the yearning. The kind of yearning that deserves
    its own tax bracket. The kind where nothing happens for 40 chapters except emotional
    devastation and somehow that is everything. '
  - "I love you for the almost-touch: fingers brushing in a crowded room, a jacket
    placed gently over tired shoulders, a lingering hand on a wrist that says \u201CI
    noticed you. I always notice you.\u201D "
  - I am mtruly so proud of this. Gotta keep working though, it hasn't reached it's
    full potential...yet.
  thirdLines:
  - This food will never make me feel as happy as Yaoi does...
  - Oh since you brought up Yaoi!!!! I think I finished it!!! Let me show you hehehehe.
    Ahem Ahem Ahem...
  - "I love you for conversations at 2 a.m., under fluorescent lights or soft moon
    glow, where one character finally cracks and the other doesn\u2019t fix him\u2014
    just stays. Just stays. "
  - "I love you for the dramatic misunderstandings that could be solved in one sentence
    but instead fuel ten chapters of exquisite suffering. Do I scream? Yes. Do I
    eat it up like it\u2019s a five-course meal? Also yes. "
  - Hmmmm. Something's not right. It needs more. Come back later, trust, it's gonna
    be even greater.
  fourthLines:
  - OH THERE YOU ARE. WELCOME TO MY YAOI CORNER OF DARKNESS.MWAHAHAHAH I FOUND YOU.
    YOU CAN'T AVOID ME FOREVER!!!
  - YOU MUST HEAR THE LATEST DRAFT OF MY POEM. IT'S REALLY GOOD I SWEAR. BEST THING
    I HAVE EVER WRITTEN IN MY LIFE.
  - NU UHHH YOU AREN'T GOING ANYWHERE UNTIL I READ THIS TO YOU. AHEM AHEM AHEM AHEMMMM.
  - 'I love you for the way love is never casual. It is important. It is life-altering.
    It is treated like a secret treasure chest buried under trauma, pride, and poorly
    timed interruptions. '
  - "I love you for the rain scenes, the hospital scenes, the \u201Csay his name
    like it\u2019s a prayer\u201D scenes. I love you for the moment one of them realizes\u2014
    oh no. this isn\u2019t admiration. this is the thing that ruins me. "
  - Awesome RIGHT?!!! No? I am going to pretend you said it is the most amazing piece
    of literature in the world. Right. Right. Anyway I am going to keep drafting.
    It isn't perfect yet...
  fifthLines:
  - HEYYYYY HEYYY! Listen I came up with these new BALLERRRR stanzas you gotta listen.
    AHEM AHEM AHEM.
  - "I love you for the soft endings, the earned confessions, the kiss that doesn\u2019t
    need description because the entire story has been the buildup. "
  - "And yes\u2014 I love you obnoxiously. I love you unapologetically. I love you
    in the way only someone who has whispered \u201CJUST COMMUNICATE\u201D at a screen
    while smiling like an idiot can. "
  - GOOD RIGHT?!??! Might I even go as far to say, AMAZING, TRANSCENDANT, and BEAUTIFUL...
  - Anyway, I am struggling to come up with the last few lines. They simply must
    be PERFECT, I need to give Yaoi the love and honor it deserves...
  sixthLines:
  - HAHHHAHHA AAAAHAHAHAHAHHAH. I FINALLY FINISHED IT. I DID IT. I MADE ART.
  - I HAVE NOT SLEPT IN WEEKS BECAUSE OF THIS, BUT IT IS ALL WORTH IT NOW! I FINALLY
    FINISHED IT. THE PERFECT ENDING!!!! HERE IT GOES.
  - AHEM AHEM AHEM AHEM AHEM AHEM.
  - 'Yaoi, you are poetry written in longing, romance stretched thin and glowing,
    two men choosing each other again and again in a world that made it hard. '
  - "And I will read you, over and over, dramatic sigh by dramatic sigh, until the
    slow burn finally ignites\u2014 and somehow, impossibly, it was worth every second. "
  - '*starts emotionally crying*'
  - I am so happy I can die in peace. Oh Yaoi, how I love you.
  - '*passes out*'
