  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 84246a412e120284ebb2f40012066458, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  charName: Christine
  firstLines:
  - Anyway that's why Tracer is the best to main.
  - Oh right. I'm teaching. Good Morning.
  - We are starting class once everyone is ready.
  - Spoiler alert. They never will be.
  secondLines:
  - Hey guys. This is the lesson for the day and shit.
  - "Learn it I guess. Don\u2019t use Chat GPT or I\u2019ll end you."
  - Anyway Imma be over here playing Overwatch if you need help just gimme a holler.
  thirdLines:
  - "I\u2019m going into a meeting now. *sigh* I wish I could play overwatch."
  fourthLines:
  - "SHHHHH I\u2019M LOCKED IN TO OVERWATCH OMG I\u2019M WINNING!!!!! "
  - YAAZZZZZZZZZ.
  fifthLines:
  - "And in conclusion, that\u2019s why Tracer is the best character in overwatch
    to main."
  - "Anyway though, It\u2019s hour 6 of Overwatch and I am still fully enjoying myself."
  sixthLines:
  - "Zzzzzz\u2026I miss my doogies\u2026 "
  - "ZZzzz Student loans. Omg how am I gonna pay my student loans\u2026"
  - ZZZZzzzzzzZZZZzzzz *snore*
