--- !u!114 &1801946696
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1801946691}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 84246a412e120284ebb2f40012066458, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  charName: Leah
  firstLines:
  - "OMG HI I\u2019m LEAH. FUN FACT ABOUT ME I LOVE OILY MEN."
  - OILY IS MY FAVORITE ADJECTIVE HOW MANY TIMES CAN I SAY OILY IN ONE BREATH LETS
    TRY.
  - OILY OILY OILY OILY OILY OILY OILY OILY OILY OILY OILY OILY OILY OILY oILy OILy
    oILy OILy oILY oiLY OILy oil- oily- *GASP*
  - Yeah that's it for now...What are you still doing here?
  secondLines:
  - "Ya know what my game is about\u2026guess\u2026.OILY MEN. hAHAHA. IM SO EXCITED."
  - OILY OILY OILY OILY OILYYYY.
  thirdLines:
  - I wanna iced latte with a double shot of espresso and a side of oily men please.
  fourthLines:
  - Ya know I love Kelise and she is such a baddie but unfortunately I am straight.
    Yeah.
  - OILY MENNNNNNNNN MMMMM.
  fifthLines:
  - "I came cause Michelle came. And I\u2019m also hungry. That too. "
  - "Hoping they have my side of Oily Men this time\u2026"
  sixthLines:
  - "Heyo. I\u2019m playing Hour 1500+ on Royale High right now."
  - I gotta get my prizes for the day ya know. I am cosplaying as an OILY MALE PRINCE
    UHHHHH.
